OL,3,CSchool 'heartbroken' by death of girl,
OL,4,Cnine, as father charged with murder
OL,6,FA school has paid tribute to a "caring
OL,7,Fand creative" nine-year-old who died
OL,8,Fin Scotland after a man was charged
OL,9,Fwith her murder.
OL,11,FMinnie Merriman from Wakefield died in
OL,12,Fhospital after she was found injured
OL,13,Fat the Elliot industrial estate in
OL,14,FArbroath, near Dundee, shortly after
OL,15,Fmidnight on Monday morning.
OL,17,FHer father, Christopher Rice, has
OL,18,Fsince been charged with murder.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
