PN,33602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1786364312
OL,3,CSchool 'heartbroken' by death of girl,
OL,4,Cnine, as father charged with murder
OL,6,FA statement was released by Minnie's
OL,7,Fschool on Thursday, saying she would
OL,8,Fbe "deeply missed".
OL,10,FKelly Ashton, Headteacher at Hendal
OL,11,FPrimary School in Kettlethorpe, said:
OL,12,F"We are heartbroken by the death of
OL,13,FMinnie.
OL,15,F"Minnie was a kind and thoughtful girl
OL,16,Fwho was loved by all of her friends.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,337,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1786364312
OL,3,CSchool 'heartbroken' by death of girl,
OL,4,Cnine, as father charged with murder
OL,6,F"She has belonged to our school
OL,7,Fcommunity for four years and will be
OL,8,Fremembered as a caring and creative
OL,9,Fgirl who was always seen with a big
OL,10,Fsmile on her face. She will be deeply
OL,11,Fmissed by us all.
OL,13,F"Our love and sympathies go out to
OL,14,Feverybody affected by this devastating
OL,15,Floss and our priority now is
OL,16,Fsupporting our pupils and staff.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,337,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1786364312
OL,3,CSchool 'heartbroken' by death of girl,
OL,4,Cnine, as father charged with murder
OL,6,F"As an active police investigation is
OL,7,Fongoing, we do ask that people do not
OL,8,Fspeculate on the circumstances
OL,9,Fsurrounding this incident and request
OL,10,Fthat the privacy of her family and our
OL,11,Fschool community is respected at this
OL,12,Fdifficult time."
OL,14,FRice, 35, appeared before Forfar
OL,15,FSheriff Court on Wednesday where he
OL,16,Fentered no plea to a count of murder.
OL,18,FHe was committed for further
OL,19,Fexamination and remanded in custody,
OL,20,Fand will appear in court again within
OL,21,Fthe next eight days.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
