CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1786364312
OL,3,CSchool 'heartbroken' by death of girl,
OL,4,Cnine, as father charged with murder
OL,6,FA tribute released by Minnie's family
OL,7,Fon Wednesday said: "We are devastated
OL,8,Fwith the loss of our beloved,
OL,9,Fabsolutely incredible, beautiful and
OL,10,Fbrave Minnie Moo.
OL,12,F"Our family asks that our privacy is
OL,13,Frespected at this extremely difficult
OL,14,Ftime."
OL,16,FIt is believed Minnie had been camping
OL,17,Fin the area with family members when
OL,18,Fshe was found injured, with Police
OL,19,FScotland saying they were not looking
OL,20,Ffor anyone else in connection.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G5/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
