OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1786364312
OL,3,CSchool 'heartbroken' by death of girl,
OL,4,Cnine, as father charged with murder
OL,6,FDet Insp Mike Ness of Police
OL,7,FScotland's major investigation team
OL,8,Fsaid: "Our thoughts remain with
OL,9,Feveryone affected by these events,
OL,10,Fespecially Minnie's family."
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G6/6
